  translation {
    text: "Affected stops:\r\nCivic Center Station Gate 7 (#35037) (eastbound)\r\nCivic Center Station Gate 7 (#35037) (westbound)\r\n18th St & Glenarm Pl (#34303) (westbound)\r\n18th St & Stout St (#17722) (westbound)\r\n18th St & Arapahoe St (#17723) (westbound)\r\nBlake St & 17th St (#17835) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 1 get on/off buses at:\r\n17th St & Welton St [ X Stop ] (#17711)\r\nBuses will layover at 17th St & Glenarm Pl/near-side\r\nFor westbound Route 1 get on/off buses at:\r\nBuses will layover at 17th St & Glenarm Pl/near-side\r\nBlake St & 14th St (#21375)"
